ivate property.\" Islamo-Communism. \"Woke War II\"", "last_comment_created": 1787283624127, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 1, "score_up": 13, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2090408508781183423", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCNODbzW", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 22, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8790882, "raw_content": "", "author": "kinbergfan", "created": 1787272881970, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "ColonelKlink", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCNODbzW.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/DefiantLs/status/2090408508781183423", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Walz: If Trump pardons Derek Chauvin, we will move him to a state prison to serve out 22.5 years in Minnesota.\n\n\nThis is the same man who pardoned a child abuser btw.", "last_comment_created": 1787285543341, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 6, "score_up": 22, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 555, "created": 1787227201000, "id": "2090408508781183423", "video": {"preview": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2090153687800750080/img/ahNMlr7usIl7NyyE.jpg", "mpeg": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2090153687800750080/pl/1e8GrVOlMWeercQK.m3u8?v=895", "aspectRatio": [640, 361], "heightRatio": 56, "type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2090153687800750080/vid/avc1/478x270/6DaSsKp--Kb3az9z.mp4"}, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1428167484406964229/Q8fS7M5X_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Defiant L\u2019s", "username": "DefiantLs"}, "content": "Walz: If Trump pardons Derek Chauvin, we will move him to a state prison to serve out 22.5 years in Minnesota\nhttps://t.co/FrWSJP3YuS\n\nThis is the same man who pardoned a child abuser btw\n\nWalz granted a pardon to Tou Lue Vang, a 42-year-old Laotian national, was convicted of", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 16467}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATCNPJnv6", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 14, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8791050, "raw_content": "\u201cSpectrum has just completed its acquisition of Cox Communications. I am excited to welcome you to Spectrum and want to explain what\u2019s staying the same and what\u2019s getting even better.\r\n\u200c\r\nIf you\u2019re not familiar with Spectrum, we are America's Connectivity Company\u00ae, now available to more than 70 million customers in 45 states providing Internet, Mobile, TV and Home Phone products delivered over our Spectrum Fiber Broadband Network. Spectrum customers are supported entirely by 100% US-based employees. Consistent with that standard, all Cox offshore sales and service will be transitioned to the United States within the next 18 months.\u201d \r\n\r\nThis is the way!", "author": "awsure", "created": 1787281713369, "profile_picture": "RloJnPUZbcln", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Maganifice7", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Just got a great message from Soectrum about their Cox acquisition ", "last_comment_created": 1787285781389, "content": "<p>\u201cSpectrum has just completed its acquisition of Cox Communications. I am excited to welcome you to Spectrum and want to explain what\u2019s staying the same and what\u2019s getting even better.\n\u200c\nIf you\u2019re not familiar with Spectrum, we are America's Connectivity Company\u00ae, now available to more than 70 million customers in 45 states providing Internet, Mobile, TV and Home Phone products delivered over our Spectrum Fiber Broadband Network. Spectrum customers are supported entirely by 100% US-based employees. Consistent with that standard, all Cox offshore sales and service will be transitioned to the United States within the next 18 months.\u201d</p>\n<p>This is the way!</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 6, "score_up": 14, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}], "status": true}